  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan - Joint Donor Team - Secondment JDT, Sudan</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sudan - Joint Donor Team</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida deltar i Joint Donor Team (JDT) i S&#xF6;dra Sudan, tillsammans med DAN, Kanada, Nederl&#xE4;nderna, Norge och Storbritannien. JDT representerar givarl&#xE4;nder r&#xF6;rande utvecklingssamarbete i S&#xF6;dra Sudan. JDT arbetar f&#xF6;r att genomf&#xF6;ra fredsavtalet Comprehensive Peace Agreement (CPA) och uppn&#xE5;endet av millenieutvecklingsm&#xE5;len.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida particpate in the Joint Donor Team (JDT) in Southern Sudan. JDT represents Sida, Canada, DEN, NOR, NL and UK regarding development cooperation. The JDT supports the implementation of the Comprehensive Peace Agreement (CPA) and the achievement of the Millenium Development Goals.</narrative>
  </description>
